  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4e2d004e-f01e-684a-9b88-6c3a19496f56"],
 " applies. Zero or nonnumeric resistance pairs cannot be converted \
meaningfully."
}], "Notes",
